{
  "mark.1.p1.b1": {
    "text": "神の子イエス・キリストの福音のはじめ。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:1"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p1.b2": {
    "text": "…見よ、わたしは使をあなたの先につかわし、あなたの道を整えさせるであろう。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p1.b3": {
    "text": "荒野で呼ばわる者の声がする、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:3"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p1.b4": {
    "text": "『主の道を備えよ、その道筋をまっすぐにせよ』",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:3"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p2.b1": {
    "text": "バプテスマのヨハネが荒野に現れて、罪のゆるしを得させる悔改めのバプテスマを宣べ伝えていた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p2.b2": {
    "text": "ユダヤ全土とエルサレムの全住民とが、彼のもとにぞくぞくと出て行って、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p2.b3": {
    "text": "自分の罪を告白し、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p3.b1": {
    "text": "わたしよりも力のあるかたが、あとからおいでになる。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:7"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p3.b2": {
    "text": "わたしはかがんで、そのくつのひもを解く値うちもない。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:7"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p3.b3": {
    "text": "わたしは水でバプテスマを授けたが、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p3.b4": {
    "text": "このかたは、聖霊によってバプテスマをお授けになるであろう。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p4.b1": {
    "text": "そのころ、イエスはガリラヤのナザレから出てきて、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:9"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p4.b2": {
    "text": "ヨルダン川で、ヨハネからバプテスマをお受けになった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:9"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p4.b3": {
    "text": "水の中から上がられるとすぐ、天が裂けて、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:10"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p5.b1": {
    "text": "聖霊がはとのように自分に下って来るのを、ごらんになった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:10"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p5.b2": {
    "text": "すると天から声があった、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p5.b3": {
    "text": "あなたはわたしの愛する子、わたしの心にかなう者である。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p6.b1": {
    "text": "それからすぐに、御霊がイエスを荒野に追いやった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:12"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p6.b2": {
    "text": "イエスは四十日のあいだ荒野にいて、サタンの試みにあわれた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p6.b3": {
    "text": "そして獣もそこにいたが、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p6.b4": {
    "text": "御使たちはイエスに仕えていた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p7.b1": {
    "text": "ヨハネが捕えられた後、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:14"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p7.b2": {
    "text": "イエスはガリラヤに行き、神の福音を宣べ伝えて言われた、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:14"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p7.b3": {
    "text": "時は満ちた、神の国は近づいた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:15"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p7.b4": {
    "text": "悔い改めて福音を信ぜよ。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:15"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p8.b1": {
    "text": "イエスはガリラヤの海べを歩いて行かれ、シモンとシモンの兄弟アンデレとが、海で網を打っているのをごらんになった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:16"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p8.b2": {
    "text": "わたしについてきなさい。あなたがたを、人間をとる漁師にしてあげよう。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:17"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p8.b3": {
    "text": "彼らはすぐに網を捨てて、イエスに従った。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p9.b1": {
    "text": "また少し進んで行かれると、ゼベダイの子ヤコブとその兄弟ヨハネとが、舟の中で網を繕っているのをごらんになった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p9.b2": {
    "text": "すぐ彼らをお招きになると、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:20"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p9.b3": {
    "text": "父ゼベダイを雇人たちと一緒に舟において、イエスのあとについて行った。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:20"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p10.b1": {
    "text": "彼らはカペナウムに行った。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:21"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p10.b2": {
    "text": "安息日にすぐ、イエスは会堂にはいって教えられた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:21"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p10.b3": {
    "text": "人々は、その教に驚いた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:22"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p10.b4": {
    "text": "律法学者たちのようにではなく、権威ある者のように、教えられたからである。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:22"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p11.b1": {
    "text": "けがれた霊につかれた者が会堂にいて、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:23"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p11.b2": {
    "text": "叫んで言った、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:23"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p11.b3": {
    "text": "ナザレのイエスよ、あなたはわたしたちとなんの係わりがあるのです。わたしたちを滅ぼしにこられたのですか。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:24"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p11.b4": {
    "text": "あなたがどなたであるか、わかっています。神の聖者です。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:24"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p11.b5": {
    "text": "イエスはこれをしかって、…と言われた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:25"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p11.b6": {
    "text": "黙れ、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:25"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p11.b7": {
    "text": "この人から出て行け",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:25"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p12.b1": {
    "text": "けがれた霊は彼をひきつけさせ、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p12.b2": {
    "text": "大声をあげて、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p12.b3": {
    "text": "その人から出て行った。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p12.b4": {
    "text": "人々はみな驚きのあまり、互に論じて言った、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p12.b5": {
    "text": "これは、いったい何事か。権威ある新しい教だ。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p12.b6": {
    "text": "けがれた霊にさえ命じられると、彼らは従うのだ。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p12.b7": {
    "text": "こうしてイエスのうわさは、たちまちガリラヤの全地方、いたる所にひろまった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:28"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p13.b1": {
    "text": "会堂を出るとすぐ、…シモンとアンデレとの家にはいって行かれた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:29"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p13.b2": {
    "text": "シモンのしゅうとめが熱病で床についていたので、人々はさっそく、そのことをイエスに知らせた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:30"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p13.b3": {
    "text": "イエスは近寄り、その手をとって起されると、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p13.b4": {
    "text": "熱が引き、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p14.b1": {
    "text": "夕暮になり日が沈むと、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:32"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p14.b2": {
    "text": "町中の者が戸口に集まった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:33"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p14.b3": {
    "text": "イエスは、さまざまの病をわずらっている多くの人々をいやし、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p14.b4": {
    "text": "また多くの悪霊を追い出された。また、悪霊どもに、物言うことをお許しにならなかった。彼らがイエスを知っていたからである。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p15.b1": {
    "text": "朝はやく、夜の明けるよほど前に、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:35"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p15.b2": {
    "text": "みんなが、あなたを捜しています",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:37"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p15.b3": {
    "text": "ほかの、附近の町々にみんなで行って、そこでも教を宣べ伝えよう。わたしはこのために出てきたのだから。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:38"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p15.b4": {
    "text": "ガリラヤ全地を巡りあるいて、諸会堂で教を宣べ伝え、また悪霊を追い出された。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:39"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p16.b1": {
    "text": "ひとりのらい病人が、イエスのところに願いにきて、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:40"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p17.b1": {
    "text": "ひざまずいて言った、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:40"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p17.b2": {
    "text": "みこころでしたら、きよめていただけるのですが。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:40"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p17.b3": {
    "text": "イエスは深くあわれみ、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:41"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p18.b1": {
    "text": "手を伸ばして彼にさわり、…と言われた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:41"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p18.b2": {
    "text": "そうしてあげよう、きよくなれ",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:41"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p19.b1": {
    "text": "らい病が直ちに去って、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:42"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p19.b2": {
    "text": "その人はきよくなった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:42"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p20.b1": {
    "text": "イエスは彼をきびしく戒めて、すぐにそこを去らせ、こう言い聞かせられた、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:43"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p20.b2": {
    "text": "何も人に話さないように、注意しなさい。ただ行って、自分のからだを祭司に見せ、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:44"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p20.b3": {
    "text": "それから、モーセが命じた物をあなたのきよめのためにささげて、人々に証明しなさい。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:44"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p20.b4": {
    "text": "彼は出て行って、自分の身に起ったことを盛んに語り、また言いひろめはじめたので、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:45"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p20.b5": {
    "text": "イエスはもはや表立っては町に、はいることができなくなり、外の寂しい所にとどまっておられた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:45"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p20.b6": {
    "text": "人々は方々から、イエスのところにぞくぞくと集まってきた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 1:45"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  }
}
